{"run": "trump_long_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 8, "idx": 0, "text_idx": 12, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 55, "letters": 202, "chars": 277, "max_new_tokens": 459, "t_start": 1790292453.711, "latency": 6.013, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 752684, "out_tokens": "197", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "367", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "197", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "564", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "76", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 459}, "params": {}, "text": "So they hand me this new phone, and they say, sir, it's very easy, all your pictures are in the cloud. The cloud? What cloud? I looked up, there's no cloud. It was a beautiful day. And they say, no, sir, it's not that kind of cloud, it's a digital cloud. A digital cloud. Okay.", "audio_s": 15.68, "rtf": 0.384, "s_per_word": 0.285, "s_per_letter": 0.0776, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.976, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "9d53b24a96b03838ddc2b60e4911a67f691476ffa061da97e6dc26ca978f58c1", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/000.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 8, "idx": 1, "text_idx": 13, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 60, "letters": 238, "chars": 315, "max_new_tokens": 536, "t_start": 1790292453.714, "latency": 5.532, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 672044, "out_tokens": "176", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "369", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "176", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "545", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "78", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 536}, "params": {}, "text": "So where is it? Nobody knows! It's somewhere. It's floating around. And I said, well, if it's floating, can it rain on my pictures? And they looked at me, and they didn't know. Nobody knows how it works. I don't think they know. And then they told me the cloud is actually in a big building somewhere in the desert.", "audio_s": 14.0, "rtf": 0.395, "s_per_word": 0.233, "s_per_letter": 0.0588, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.74, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "e71fa2b86f2252d9fc9cc47a5d1cefbfd8fef93da100b61df54061bfef1466eb", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/001.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 8, "idx": 2, "text_idx": 14, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 55, "letters": 211, "chars": 281, "max_new_tokens": 478, "t_start": 1790292453.717, "latency": 5.431, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 664364, "out_tokens": "174", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "362", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "174", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "536", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "71", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 478}, "params": {}, "text": "Sometimes, late at night, I sit out on the terrace and I look at the ocean, and I think about things. Big things. What does it all mean? What's the secret to a great deal? And you know what I've come to realize? It's not the money. Everybody thinks it's the money. It's the timing.", "audio_s": 13.84, "rtf": 0.392, "s_per_word": 0.252, "s_per_letter": 0.0656, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.825, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "d17041f75fb2cffa488b037d310cb1c39da5310abd8661118a01b96c3a980c62", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/002.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 8, "idx": 3, "text_idx": 15, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 58, "letters": 225, "chars": 296, "max_new_tokens": 508, "t_start": 1790292453.718, "latency": 5.745, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 691244, "out_tokens": "181", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "363", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "181", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "544", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "72", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 508}, "params": {}, "text": "It's knowing when to walk away, and knowing when to stay at the table. Maybe life is like that too. Maybe life is one very long negotiation. I don't know. I think about it a lot. More than people would think. Maybe the ocean knows. It's been around a long time, longer than me, believe it or not.", "audio_s": 14.4, "rtf": 0.399, "s_per_word": 0.248, "s_per_letter": 0.064, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.805, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "8d368bfbfac939ac84770f6dde3e07f07bf0a1a5f1463066941d386eaade327e", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/003.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 8, "idx": 4, "text_idx": 16, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 56, "letters": 230, "chars": 300, "max_new_tokens": 519, "t_start": 1790292453.719, "latency": 6.387, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 817964, "out_tokens": "214", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "365", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "214", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "579", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "74", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 519}, "params": {}, "text": "You know what makes me happy? Honestly? It's the simple things. Long day, a lot of meetings, a lot of phone calls, big decisions. And then at the end of it, I sit down in my favorite chair, and somebody brings me a nice cheeseburger and a cold Diet Coke. Beautiful. The ketchup, the pickles, perfect.", "audio_s": 17.04, "rtf": 0.375, "s_per_word": 0.304, "s_per_letter": 0.0741, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.932, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "764a8a9ee19489bd94febc0ad04598f5b716c782ecba054193533b7202ae4c02", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/004.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 8, "idx": 5, "text_idx": 17, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 59, "letters": 225, "chars": 301, "max_new_tokens": 508, "t_start": 1790292453.721, "latency": 6.426, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 821804, "out_tokens": "215", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "369", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "215", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "584", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "78", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 508}, "params": {}, "text": "And I just sit there, and I watch a little television, and I think, this is good. This is really good. People think you need a lot to be happy. You don't. A good burger, a good chair. That's it. That's the whole secret. Maybe some ice cream later. Two scoops. Everybody else gets one scoop, I get two.", "audio_s": 17.12, "rtf": 0.375, "s_per_word": 0.29, "s_per_letter": 0.0761, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.957, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "561e1bd9a3d098512ae024fda5dd4fb53fabbe5cbedc4730e811bcd94689a00b", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/005.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 8, "idx": 6, "text_idx": 18, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 61, "letters": 250, "chars": 330, "max_new_tokens": 562, "t_start": 1790292453.723, "latency": 6.34, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 806444, "out_tokens": "211", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "373", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "211", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "584", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "82", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 562}, "params": {}, "text": "They told me it couldn't be done. They said, you'll never build a golf course on that land, it's too rocky, too windy, too everything. And I said, watch me. Watch me. We brought in the best people, the best builders, the best grass, the greenest grass you've ever seen. We worked day and night, through the rain, through the wind.", "audio_s": 16.8, "rtf": 0.377, "s_per_word": 0.275, "s_per_letter": 0.0672, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.845, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "501f435f146324455a08f33476f2fd1adee6be7a993b42caa49aa5d4a66c8697", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/006.wav"}
{"run": "trump_long_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 8, "idx": 7, "text_idx": 19, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 57, "letters": 220, "chars": 295, "max_new_tokens": 498, "t_start": 1790292453.725, "latency": 5.676, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 683564, "out_tokens": "179", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "367", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "179", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "546", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "76", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 498}, "params": {}, "text": "And we did not stop. We never stop. And today, it's one of the greatest courses in the world. So when somebody tells me something is impossible, I don't hear impossible. I hear, let's get to work. That's how we do it. That's how we've always done it, and that's how we're going to keep doing it.", "audio_s": 14.24, "rtf": 0.399, "s_per_word": 0.25, "s_per_letter": 0.0647, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.814, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "15852e3c286b9547c34c7deafd9baaf9c4e09fb07797810e7a437816842e5ec4", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/007.wav"}
